		<table style="width: 100%">
		<tr><th id="1">イワトビペンギン</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_024.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_024_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_024.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_025.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_025_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_025.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_026.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_026_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_026.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">土台の岩石部分は安っぽいんですが、イワトビペンギンにはマッチしています。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="2">タカアシガニ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_042.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_042_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_042.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_043.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_043_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_043.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_044.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_044_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_044.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">全国の水族館の深海水槽によくいる、世界最大の節足動物。<br />
			こんな元気に動いている姿は見たこと無いですけどね。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="3">トラフグ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_029.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_029_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_029.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_032.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_032_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_032.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_030.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_030_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_030.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_031.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_031_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_031.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">ふくらんでフグらしい状態で立体化しており、クリア素材で透け感がなかなかいい感じです。<br />
			斑点模様は数を絞っていますが、特徴をよく表現しています。<br />
			<br />
			2015年版では山口県の海響館でしか入手できませんでした。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="4">アオウミガメ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_033.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_033_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_033.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_034.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_034_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_034.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_035.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_035_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_035.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">ツヤツヤの甲羅は本作でも健在。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="5">イロワケイルカ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_013.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_014.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_014.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_015.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_015.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_016.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">仙台うみの杜水族館限定だったイロワケイルカ。<br />
			白と黒のモノクロカラーの動物が陸にも海にもいるのは、やはり何かしら生存に有利なのだろうか。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="6">オニイトマキエイ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_036.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_036_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_036.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_037.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_037_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_037.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_038.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_038_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_038.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">英名「マンタ」は「マント」から来ているらしい。<br />
			和名は「糸巻き」、偶然にもどちらも被服に関連するのですね。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="7">ジンベエザメ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_017.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_017.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_018.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_018.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_019.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_019_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_019.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">やたらツヤツヤのジンベエザメ。<br />
			かつては海遊館限定でしたが、解説書やDPなど、各種素材には「海遊館限定」とは書かれていませんでした。<br />
			沖縄美ら海水族館やのとじま水族館でも販売できるような汎用性を持たせたのでしょう。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="8">シロワニ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_020.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_020.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_021.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_021.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_022.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_022_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_022.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_023.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_023_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_023.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">大型のものでは3メートルを超えるため、水族館にいると「おお！」となります。<br />
			おそろしげな風貌に対して、性格は温厚。<br />
			しかし、生まれる前は母親の胎内できょうだい達を共食いするという生態であり、やっぱり恐ろしいサメだ。<br />
			<br />
			もともと大洗アクアワールド限定でした。</td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_055.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_055_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_055.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_056.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_056_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_056.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment"><a href="../../zuroku/zuroku1">図録１</a>のものよりひとまわり大きめ。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="9">アカメ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_048.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_048_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_048.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_050.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_050_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_050.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_049.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_049_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_049.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_052.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_052_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_052.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">ラインナップの淡水魚代表、アカメ。<br />
			かつて<a href="../../../kaiyodo_syokugann/bussanntenn/Chugokushikoku">ビールのおまけ</a>で付いてきましたが、今やビールの値段も超え500円。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="10">オオカミウオ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_045.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_045_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_045.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_047.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_047_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_047.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_046.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_046_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_046.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_051.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_051_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_051.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">冷たい海に棲む恐ろしい顔のサカナ。<br />
			今回も頭を大きく作るため、岩礁から顔を出した半身モデルになっています。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="11">スナメリ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_039.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_039_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_039.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_040.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_040_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_040.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_041.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_041_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_041.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">なんとなく人間臭い顔で、笑っているかのように見えるのがチャーミング。<br />
			分割線が無いのが、大きなカプセルの利点。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="12">カマイルカ</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_027.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_027_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_027.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_028.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_028_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_028.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_012.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_012.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">
			初版よりも陰影の塗装が濃くなっています。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="">カプセル</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="img/nihonno2019_009.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_009.jpg" --></a><a href="img/nihonno2019_010.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/nihonno2019_010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/AQUARIUMFIGURECOLLECTION/aquarium_of_japan_2019/img/nihonno2019_010.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">前回は白カプセルで中が見づらかったですが、今回は開けなくても中が分かります。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="">解説書</th></tr>
		<tr><td><img height="195" src="img/nihonno2019_book1.jpg" width="378" /><img height="189" src="img/nihonno2019_book2.jpg" width="378" /></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">前回と同じデザイン。<br />
			原型師の記載も今回は無し。</td></tr>
		<!--
		-->
		<tr><th id="">DP</th></tr>
		<tr><td><a href="../../../blog/img2020_07_12/blog20200714_257.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="../../../blog/img2020_07_12/blog20200714_257_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/blog/img2020_07_12/blog20200714_257.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
		<tr><td class="comment">このご時勢でこのラインナップ数は結構すごい。</td></tr>
